{
  "_doc": "Event rooms. Each choice has a reward and a risk the Leader weighs by temperament (headless), and outcomes rolled by chance. Outcome kinds: loot {items, each (per floor)}, heal {pct}, hurt {pct}, torch {n}, embers {n}, xp {n per floor}, ambush {room}, reveal, dropItem {n}.",
